    <!-- How to play -->
    <string name="rules_title">How to play</string>
    <string name="rules_body">• Roll the dice on your turn, then tap a glowing token to move it.\n• A token leaves the yard only on a 6.\n• A 6 gives you another roll. Three 6s in a row lose the turn.\n• Land on a single opponent token to send it back to its yard and roll again. Star squares and start squares are safe.\n• Two or more tokens of one color on one square are a safe pair. A safe pair cannot be captured. Any token can pass it or land on its square to share it.\n• You need the exact number to reach home. A token reaching home gives another roll.\n• You have 30 seconds per turn. Miss 3 turns in a row and you lose.\n• First to bring all four tokens home wins.\n• Lucky Boost 🍀 (a room setting, on by default): if none of your tokens is on the board and you have rolled no 6 for 3 turns in a row, your chance of a 6 goes up: 1 in 3 on the next turn, then 1 in 2, and the turn after that is always a 6. It never applies while you have a token on the board (the home column counts).</string>
